Modified 2026-11-02 by PRP contributors.
The only behavioral change is scheduleSendStreamFrameRequest(boolean) in
tech/kwik/core/stream/StreamOutputStreamImpl.java. It backports the method from
official tech.kwik:kwik:0.12.1: reserve the send request with compareAndSet(0, 1)
before publishing its callback, preventing a sender from decrementing an
unpublished reservation and stranding buffered stream data.
No application-specific behavior, reflection, retry policy, or wire change is added.

